can also be enabled

00:29:45.090 --> 00:29:49.590
in multiple channels in surfaces
from text to voice to phone.

00:29:49.590 --> 00:29:51.940
So beyond the web
chat core feature,

00:29:51.940 --> 00:29:54.490
which we saw when we tested
it out in the console,

00:29:54.490 --> 00:29:57.390
you can use the built-in
feature for deploying your agent

00:29:57.390 --> 00:29:59.100
onto any Google
Assistant enabled

00:29:59.100 --> 00:30:02.430
device, such as the Assistant
Mobile app or a Google Home

00:30:02.430 --> 00:30:03.580
device.

00:30:03.580 --> 00:30:06.150
So you can also easily
integrate your Dialogflow agent

00:30:06.150 --> 00:30:09.120
into other third party apps,
like Facebook Messenger,

00:30:09.120 --> 00:30:10.650
Twitter, and Slack.

00:30:10.650 --> 00:30:13.230
And there are also import
and export capabilities

00:30:13.230 --> 00:30:15.510
for easily importing
your Dialogflow agent

00:30:15.510 --> 00:30:19.215
into Amazon Alexa or Microsoft
Cortana compatible files.

00:30:22.470 --> 00:30:25.470
So while Dialogflow gives
